## Implementation Notes

### Tailwind CSS

These tokens map to Tailwind's default configuration. Customize in `tailwind.config.js` if needed:

```javascript
module.exports = {
  theme: {
    extend: {
      colors: {
        primary: {
          DEFAULT: '#3B82F6',
          hover: '#2563EB',
          active: '#1D4ED8',
        },
        // ... other colors
      },
    },
  },
};
```

### CSS Variables

For non-Tailwind projects, use CSS custom properties:

```css
:root {
  --color-primary: #3B82F6;
  --color-primary-hover: #2563EB;
  --space-4: 16px;
  --text-base: 16px;
  /* ... */
}

[data-theme="dark"] {
  --color-primary: #60A5FA;
  /* ... */
}
```

